  "presentation_scope": "All 30 formal defining H,K,U equations remain encoded as source claims, not an assumption of a complete verified presentation or word basis. The b_i are uniquely determined local coefficients. Following the approved saved-source sign corrections to c1=c4, c15 and the derived b3 term, quartic_full passes exactly in all eleven representations and is included in acceptance checks. Printed c5,c7,c8 and the c0 closure are unchanged; the apparent Delta shift compensated for the stale word-term sign. The wholesale saved eq:Hrelsb replacement at threestring-top.tex:85-91 is the literal K1=K2=U1=U2=0 specialization of quartic_full: both LHS terms and all ten RHS terms match, including the (c5-c7) commutator. top_quartic_b passes exactly in all six top irreducibles (squared dimensions 20) and is now required. All formerly unresolved ordinary quartic assertions pass; prior failures are historical evidence only. The reconstruction verifies the derived word relation, not independently the five-boundary diagram identity.",
  "source": [
