  "provenance": {
    "base_commit": "0149631bb3c8bf73369001d239e00ab5ae718f27",
    "change": "Encode the formal full H,K,U presentation by local references plus mixed and quartic words; classify additional and quotient identities. No stored matrix or local coefficient is changed in that step. Migrate profile version metadata to 0.2.0. Follow-up: move b coefficients to local ownership and correct b_3 to -e2 by the faithful five-character linear system, not by quartic fitting. Author-directed continuation: classify top_quartic_b as unresolved diagnostic without changing its formula or applicability; register C_star, A and the initially failing source-faithful Y2 candidate. Current follow-up: reconcile the author-approved saved Y2 S1 correction and its rotation/bar counterparts, register source-faithful Y2_star and X2, and complete all eleven representations. All acceptance checks now pass. No c coefficient, quartic term or other existing matrix is changed. Subsequent author-approved saved-source correction: reverse c1=c4 and c15, and change the b3 contribution in quartic_full to plus (threestring.tex:232). All other coefficient formulas, the c0 closure, local b values and every representation byte are unchanged. The independent reconstruction and its stale-sign diagnostic history are retained. Earlier pass from 0149631: copy the saved top eq:Hrelsb c11/c12 word-pairing correction at threestring-top.tex:91-92. Coefficients, quartic_full and matrices are unchanged. Exact top residuals remain nonzero; retain unresolved status. The prior complete top residuals are preserved at base_commit:reports/a3_representation_residuals.json. Subsequent wholesale saved-source replacement of eq:Hrelsb: correct LHS, c15 orientation and c11/c12 word differences, and restore the (c5-c7) commutator. Exact literal quotient comparison and all-six-representation verification pass; promote top_quartic_b to source_claim. The immediate pre-replacement uncommitted relation and full residuals are frozen in reports/a3_top_quotient_history.json. No coefficient, full quartic, or matrix changes.",
